Declare the vendored packages introduced by the runc CVE backports in vendor/modules.txt.

CVE-2025-31133.patch and CVE-2025-52565.patch add whole new package trees to the vendor
directory ("github.com/opencontainers/runc/internal/..." and
"github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/...") but never declared them in
vendor/modules.txt. That was tolerated while the module was built with the old "go 1.22.0"
directive, but Go enforces it from language level 1.23 onwards, so once the module bump raises
the directive the toolchain rejects an import whose package is not listed there:

    cannot find module providing package github.com/opencontainers/runc/internal/pathrs:
    import lookup disabled by -mod=vendor

This is not specific to the 1.26.0 directive we end up with: grpc v1.83.2 already requires
"go 1.25.0", so the declarations are needed for any version of this bump.

The recorded language level for both modules is raised from go1.13/go1.17 to go1.18 for the
same reason: the backported code uses generics and "any". go1.18 is deliberately the smallest
level that compiles it - go1.22 would additionally change for-loop variable scoping for the
rest of the vendored runc v1.1.12 sources, which were written against the old semantics.

The vendor tarball (Source2) is generated by "go work vendor" before any patch is applied, so
it cannot know about these packages; they have to be declared here instead.

Signed-off-by: Sumit Jena <v-sumitjena@microsoft.com>
--- a/vendor/modules.txt
+++ b/vendor/modules.txt
@@ -173,8 +173,18 @@
 ## explicit; go 1.11
 github.com/cpuguy83/go-md2man/v2/md2man
 # github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin v0.2.4
-## explicit; go 1.13
+## explicit; go 1.18
 github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/internal/consts
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal/assert
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal/fd
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal/gocompat
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal/kernelversion
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal/linux
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/internal/procfs
+github.com/cyphar/filepath-securejoin/pathrs-lite/procfs
 # github.com/davecgh/go-spew v1.1.1
 ## explicit
 # github.com/davecgh/go-spew v1.1.2-0.20180830191138-d8f796af33cc
@@ -629,7 +639,9 @@
